<title>USA: Oakland, Calif., won by BancAmerica.</title>
<headline>Oakland, Calif., won by BancAmerica.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancAmerica Securities said it won $22.250 million of Oakland Calif., general obligation bonds, Series 1997 C, measure K, with a true interest cost of 5.7525 percent.</p>
</text>
